## 3. On-Page SEO Analysis

Analyze:

- Title tag strategy
- Meta descriptions
- Heading structures
- Keyword targeting
- Content organization
- Internal linking patterns
- Image optimization
- Schema markup usage
- Landing page optimization


## 4. Keyword Competitor Analysis

